"executable-evidence candidate coverage + exact-set publication.
"Candidate membership is limited to evidence that can actually bind to replay:
" 1) eligible nontechnical fields serialized in the exact raw recording, and
" 2) eligible native FIELD_VALS from live Guided Recording.
"Exact SAP screen metadata is still read, but ONLY to enrich/verify labels for
"those executable candidates. A screen control absent from raw/native evidence
"is not offered as a fake Template candidate. User confirmation remains the
"sole membership authority; final Mapping must equal the confirmed set exactly.

"acquisition review is a real UI phase.
"Import/Guided Recording first loads the exact RAW rows into Screen 0800.
"Only an explicit Mapping Profile command may start user-action confirmation
"and schema/onboarding. This keeps UI order independent from compiler order.
DATA: gv_z689_review_pending TYPE abap_bool,
