    CHANGING lv_text.
  IF lv_text IS INITIAL.
    RETURN.
  ENDIF.

  CONDENSE lv_text NO-GAPS.

  TRY.
      lv_hours = CONV i( lv_text ).
    CATCH cx_sy_conversion_no_number.
